- net
- scope
- scope_foot
- scope_mount
- weave

' The forum's own hand. In a forum this world keeps, every message a
' member has handed in and the keeper has not yet accepted is accepted:
' written into the conversation under the next number, with who handed it
' in and under what name. So the conversation is the keeper's own records,
' in the order the keeper wrote them. A message is read only from the
' world that fills the seat it was handed in under (weave/seen), as
' anything is.
+ forum_mount
  + home
    \ self=iota
    ^ path
    [self 'io 'forum]
  + took
    ' Whether the conversation already holds what a member handed in
    ' under a name.
    \ held=row[myth] from=str at=str
    ^ bool
    = same held.keep((\ m=myth (and (equal[str] m.txt_at(['from]) from) (equal[str] m.txt_at(['at]) at))))
    | gt same.len 0
  + said
    \ text=str from=str at=str
    ^ myth
    . (myth/sing ['said] (pails/t text))
      put(['from] (pails/t from))
      put(['at] (pails/t at))
  + one
    ' One forum this world keeps: what its members handed in that the
    ' conversation does not hold yet, accepted in the order found.
    \ c=weave/comp s=weave/side acc=row[[p=path q=writ]] state=namespace
    ^ row[[p=path q=writ]]
    = none=row[myth] []
      spot=path ['messages]
      talk=path s.root.weld(spot)
      held
        | (sovereign_peek talk state).tap.fold none
          \ out [rel record]
          ? !(eq rel.len 1) out
          | out.snoc(record)
      seats=path (weave/from c s c.maker).weld(['members])
      start=[n=nat w=row[[p=path q=writ]]] [held.len acc]
      done
        | (sovereign_peek seats state).tap.fold start
          \ got [rel seat]
          ? !(eq rel.len 1) got
          = member seat.nat_at(['world] 0)
            name=path [rel.at(0)]
            from (path_show name)
            box=path (weave/from c s member).weld(['members rel.at(0) 'said])
          ? (eq 0 member) got
          | (sovereign_peek box state).tap.fold got
            \ now [key line]
            ? !(eq key.len 1) now
            = [n w] now
              at (path_show key)
            ? (forum_mount/took held from at) now
            = next n.inc
              target=path talk.snoc(($u next))
              step=[n=nat w=row[[p=path q=writ]]] [next w.snoc([target (writ/make (forum_mount/said line.txt_at(['said]) from at))])]
            step
    = [n w] done
    w
  + accepted
    ' Everything this world has to accept, in every forum it keeps.
    \ state=namespace
    ^ row[[p=path q=writ]]
    = none=row[[p=path q=writ]] []
      mine=path [state.self 'gov 'forum]
    | (sovereign_peek (scope_foot/home state.self) state).tap.fold none
      \ acc [rel record]
      ? !(eq rel.len 1) acc
      ?> (./some held) record.get(['make]) acc
      ?> link=safe held acc
      ? !(equal[path] link.path mine) acc
      ?> (./some found) (scope_foot/part record state) acc
      = [c s] found
      | forum_mount/one c s acc state
  + start
    \ server=nat self=iota arguments=row[str]
    ^ nat
    | scope_mount/hand server (forum_mount/home self) forum_mount/accepted
